ascript\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">JavaScript<\/a>, UI\/UX design, web graphics, responsive design, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-seo\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SEO<\/a> basics, and website layout creation. It helps build practical skills required to create modern and professional websites.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>With the rapid growth of startups, businesses, and digital services, the demand for skilled web designers continues to rise. This field opens career opportunities in design, development, digital marketing, and user experience roles.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td><strong>Particulars<\/strong><\/td><td><strong>Details<\/strong><\/td><\/tr><tr><td><strong>Course name<\/strong><\/td><td>Web Designing Course<\/td><\/tr><tr><td><strong>Course level<\/strong><\/td><td>Certificate, Diploma, Undergraduate (UG), Postgraduate (PG)<\/td><\/tr><tr><td><strong>Eligibility<\/strong><\/td><td><strong>-UG:<\/strong> Passed 10+2 in any stream from a recognized board.<br><strong>-PG:<\/strong> Bachelor\u2019s degree from a recognized university<\/td><\/tr><tr><td><strong>Course Fees<\/strong><\/td><td>INR 10,000 to INR 2,00,000 (varies by institute and course level)<\/td><\/tr><tr><td><strong>Course Duration<\/strong><\/td><td><strong>-UG: <\/strong>3 &#8211; 4 Years<br><strong>-PG:<\/strong> 2 Years<br><strong>-Certificate\/Diploma: <\/strong>1 Month to 2 Years<\/td><\/tr><tr><td><strong>Entrance exams<\/strong><\/td><td>NIFT, NID, UCEED, SEED, UID, institute-level entrance tests<\/td><\/tr><tr><td><strong>Average salary<\/strong><\/td><td>INR 2.2 LPA (entry-level), can increase to 5\u20136 LPA with experience<\/td><\/tr><tr><td><strong>Top recruiters<\/strong><\/td><td>Cisco, TCS, Cognizant, Deloitte, Accenture, Google, etc.<\/td><\/tr><tr><td><strong>Job profiles<\/strong><\/td><td>Web Designer, Web Developer, UI Designer, Graphic Designer, Layout Designer, Front-End Developer<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Objectives of Web Designing Course Syllabus<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>The objective of a web designing course syllabus is to build strong design, development, and practical skills required to create modern, responsive websites. Below are the key objectives:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Understand Basics:<\/strong> Learn HTML, CSS, and website structure to build a strong foundation. It helps beginners understand how web pages are created, structured, and displayed across different devices and browsers.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Build Design Skills:<\/strong> Develop creativity by learning layout design, color theory, typography, and UI\/UX principles. These skills help create visually appealing, user-friendly, and engaging website interfaces, improving user experience, navigation, and overall website performance.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Develop Technical Skills:<\/strong> Gain knowledge of JavaScript and modern frameworks to add interactivity and functionality. This helps learners create dynamic websites with better performance and user experience.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Create Real Projects:<\/strong> Work on practical projects like websites, landing pages, and applications. This helps in applying learned concepts, improving problem-solving skills, and building a strong portfolio.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Prepare for Career:<\/strong> Become job-ready by learning industry-relevant tools, best practices, and workflows. It also helps in preparing for interviews and exploring freelance or full-time career opportunities.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n    <!-- LOTTIE SCRIPT -->\n    <script src=\"https:\/\/unpkg.com\/@lottiefiles\/lottie-player@latest\/dist\/lottie-player.js\"><\/script>\n\n    <section class=\"wscube-courses mb-2\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h3 class=\"mb-4\">Recommended Professional <\/br> Certificates<